      <h3 id="_specoauth2" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.oauth2<a href="#_specoauth2" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>oauth2 defines the OAuth2 settings used by the client.</p>
      <p>It requires Prometheus &gt;= 2.27.0.</p>
      <p>Cannot be set at the same time as <code>authorization</code>, <code>basicAuth</code> or <code>bearerTokenSecret</code>.</p>
      </dd>
